SUMMARY:Dia de los Muertos
LOCATION:Hollywood Forever\, Hollywood
DESCRIPTION:27TH ANNUAL DIA DE LOS MUERTOS AT HOLLYWOOD FOREVER ALL UNDER O
 
NE SKY - BAJO UN MISMO CIELO SATURDAY OCTOBER 24TH 2026 NOON - MIDNIGHT FUL
 
L EVENT SCHEDULE HERE FEATURING: DANNYLUX TRISH TOLEDO TROPA MAGICA LOS SHA
 
DOWS DJ QUE MADRE DJ JOAQU.N DJ DRO BARLO THERE ARE 3 WINDOWS OF ADMISSION:
 
 12PM-4PM 4PM-7PM 7PM-11PM YOU MAY STAY PAST YOUR WINDOW OF ADMISSSION EVEN
 
T WEBSITE: ladayofthedead.com ALTARS EXHIBITION CEREMONIAL PROCESSION MUSIC
 
AL PERFORMANCES ON THE MUERTE Y TRADICIÓN STAGE CHILDRENS PLAZA El CINE & 
 
EL TEATRO PLAZA CATHEDRAL ART EXHIBITION AZTECS FOLKLORICO ARTS & CRAFTS VE
 
NDORS CULINARY VENDORS AWARDS Altars : Winner $5\,000\, 2nd $3500\, 3rd $25
 
00 Costumes: Winner $1000 & Runner Up $500 VIP TICKETS The VIP ticket gives
 
 you access to the VIP Oasis in the middle of the event which includes prem
 
ium food and beverage vendors for purchase\, lounge seating\, private main 
 
stage viewing area\, cell phone charging\, free WIFI\, and premium face pai
 
nting vendors for purchase. Free beverage tastings on 1st come 1st served b
 
asis. VISIT LADAYOFTHEDEAD.COM FOR FULL SCHEDULE OF EVENTS * LINEUP AND SCH
 
EDULE SUBJECT TO CHANGE AT ANY TIME * * NO REFUNDS / NO EXCHANGES * * 5 AND
 
 UP REQUIRE TICKETS * PARKING Parking in structures on Van Ness Ave and Gow
 
er St and additional locations. More details emailed to ticket purchasers p
 
rior to event date. ABOUT THE THEME: This past year has reminded us how dee
 
ply our lives are woven together. Across the world\, families have endured 
 
separation\, communities have mourned\, and many have searched for peace\, 
 
comfort\, and healing. In times of sorrow\, we are reminded that suffering 
 
knows no borders---and neither should compassion. Yet even in difficult tim
 
es\, there are moments that draw us closer. Through music\, art\, tradition
 
\, celebration\, and remembrance\, people gather across cultures and contin
 
ents to share joy\, offer comfort\, and dream together. In those moments\, 
 
the distance between us seems to disappear\, revealing the bonds that have 
 
always connected us. The same sun rises over each of us. The same moon watc
 
hes over those we love. The same stars that guided our ancestors continue t
 
o shine above us today. Wherever we may stand upon this earth\, we are all 
 
bajo un mismo cielo --- under one sky. Día de los Muertos reminds us that 
 
love knows no borders. Memory belongs to us all. Grief belongs to us all. H
 
ope belongs to us all. When we gather to honor our ancestors\, we are remin
 
ded that every life leaves behind a story---and every story is worthy of be
 
ing remembered. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/dia-de-los-
 
muertos-hollywood-forever-tickets/15002103
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/dia-de-los-muertos-hollywood-forever-ti
 
ckets/15002103
END:VEVENT
